{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>藝人張振朗、劉穎鏇、周嘉洛和朱敏瀚在台慶夜大展身手，於「極速狂奔Speed and Stunt」環節中表現極亮眼。尤其於綵排時曾於逾2米高地方摔下的朱敏瀚，在表演環節中，完美演繹由逾2米躍下的動作，動作相當利落，劉穎鏇亦打得十分精彩，技驚四座！完成演出後，大家輪住感謝特技人的付出，以及多謝今個環節的主舵人錢嘉樂。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:29.437649+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:42:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:57:13.786739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:13:41.335011+00:00","content_hash":"1151e56419c5bc9f37b64ce08e041ae12a625eeeb3d0abbf3e2e3570760d82eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:20:29.437649+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}